# Your rule content
Redfish is a DMTF standard.
Enforce Redfish CamelCase naming style for API Types and properties.

Developer Redfish environment must be set up with `npm run schema:setup`
After schema:setup:
- Use [openapi.yaml](mdc:src/api/schema/openapi.yaml) as model API interaction for this project.
- All generated Redfish endpoints are located src/api/endpoints/redfish.gen.ts
    - stripped version for check-in/building is always here: src/api/endpoints/redfish.dist.ts
- All generated Redfish Models are located here: src/api/model

Do not create intermediate models for UI use, *always* use/extend generated Redfish models.

